    "sha": "3d4a2b6bcf2deadd869438dd81a3d8d49912ab81",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOKDql7toAKDNkNGEyYjZiY2YyZGVhZGQ4Njk0MzhkZDgxYTNkOGQ0OTkxMmFiODE",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "MohamedRejeb",
        "email": "mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-03-16T17:19:00Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "MohamedRejeb",
        "email": "mohamedrejeb445@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-03-16T17:19:00Z"
      },
      "message": "Enhance WebView navigation state and fix recomposition loops\n\n- Update `rememberWebViewState` to use `LaunchedEffect` for content updates, preventing potential recomposition loops\n- Synchronize `canGoBack` and `canGoForward` navigator states across iOS and Desktop platforms\n- iOS: Implement support for additional HTTP headers using `NSMutableURLRequest` and improve `loadHTMLString` handling\n- Desktop: Ensure navigation events are executed on the JavaFX UI thread using `Platform.runLater`\n- Android: Fix scope for `loadUrl` call and remove debug logging in `CookieManager`\n- iOS: Enable `allowsBackForwardNavigationGestures` based on `captureBackPresses` configuration",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "024f4e933f50ee856eb29efa9d41d9cee2e59ace",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/git/trees/024f4e933f50ee856eb29efa9d41d9cee2e59ace"
